OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMany parts
OL,6,Fdry with clear spells allowing it to
OL,7,Fturn chilly across northern parts.
OL,8,FRisk of some heavy rain initially in
OL,9,Fthe far southeast, then more
OL,10,Fwidespread cloud and patchy rain
OL,11,Fmoving north across southern England
OL,12,Fand Wales later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FCloud and patchy drizzle will
OL,15,Fquickly spread northwards tomorrow
OL,16,Fwith winds continuing to freshen in
OL,17,Fthe west. Very warm in the south come
OL,18,Fthe afternoon with sunny spells
OL,19,Fdeveloping.
